## Current scientific posture

The strongest prospective new paper is **not** “finite-field quantum mechanics is possible” and is **not** “circulant algebra is new.” Those are established areas.

The research question is whether an independently motivated Boolean logical-operator representation has a native geometric rotation whose lift:

1. selects a particular rotation-equivariant Boolean operator algebra;
2. induces semantic bridges between properties of Boolean functions and properties of the lifted operators;
3. yields a principled restricted modal state/gate/measurement theory;
4. has model-specific contextuality/resource classifications not captured by unrestricted finite-field rank alone.

Astra is explicitly instructed to try to disprove novelty and to find stronger general theorems under unrelated terminology.
